            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Molly"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is a nice summer salad. It is best when all the ingredients are cold. The submitter suggested using cantaloupe in place of the honeydew and that is what I did. The dressing is light and the curry powder adds a nice touch of flavor. Thanks Jen for sharing.",
            "datePublished": "2011-08-01T16:04:18.557Z"
          },
          {
